<p>Hello <%= @user.first_name %>,</p>

<p>
  Someone has replied to your comment on the discussion thread. Here's what they said:
</p>

<hr>

<div style="margin: 16px 0;">
  <p style="margin: 0;">
    <strong><%= @comment.user.first_name %> <%= @comment.user.last_name %></strong> wrote:
  </p>
  <blockquote style="margin: 8px 0; padding-left: 12px; border-left: 3px solid #ccc;">
    <%= @comment.content %>
  </blockquote>
  <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #888; margin-top: 0;">
    Posted <%= time_ago_in_words(@comment.created_at) %> ago
  </p>
</div>

<hr>

<p>
  Click the button below to view the full discussion and reply:
</p>

<p>
  <a href="<%= question_url(@question) %>" style="background-color: #4CAF50; color: white; padding: 10px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px;">
    View Discussion
  </a>
</p>
<br>
<p>Thanks,<br>The Slinghealth Team</p>
